  "thread_ts": "1759256494.852159",
  "text": "Done. Brief (doc) and hand-off list (sheet) are in my Drive, shared view-only with you, Brian, Robert and PlayableX intake. Both links are posted in the PlayableX channel.\n\nCounts across the 96 lines of Brian's pack list:\n• **Delivered: 8**: Couch, Couch and Pillow, Grenade, Plushie Bunny, Plushie Chick, Cannon, Background, Zombie characters (Marcus's pack)\n• **Ready: 48**\n• **Owed: 40**\n\nWhere Brian's notes no longer hold:\n• **Bathroom (12)**: Claire said on 29 Sep she's redoing the UVs and that Friday's files are the old version. They go again from her.\n• **Cactus, Chainsaw, Cone**: new colour versions were made 29 Sep, after export. They go again from Claire. Cactus is one of the default 8, and the only default item still owed.\n• **8 music instruments**: per Brian's note on 30 Sep, the zip got cut off on upload and they aren't in the folder. Brian will put them back.\n• **Rocket and Explosion sounds**: these are from Soundly and an Asset Store pack, so they stay with us until Calvin makes our own versions.\n\nThe rest of Owed: Claire 6 models not exported yet, Brian 5 exports plus 2 Figma PNG lines, Calvin the music loop, Martin the fonts. All 40 Owed tickets are in Todo with a comment. Robert's picks stand: walk, plus Party Girl, Plumber, Magician and Football Player."
 },
