  "channel": "C08H78VJG80",
  "thread_ts": null,
  "text": "Hi <@PERSON_6078_SLACK_ID>, ahead of the 3 Nov kickoff, here's what you'll build from and what's still coming from us. Both are shared view-only with intake@playablex.ai.\n\n• **Brief:** https://docs.google.com/document/d/bb80b125a1c2ab9fbb268584/edit\n  Scenario 1, the 8 default board items (every other board item is a swap-in extra), the 4 zombies with the walk animation only (Party Girl, Plumber, Magician, Football Player, all from the Unity package you've reviewed), win/lose and the 7-slot tray, sound, and the music-after-first-tap rule.\n• **Hand-off list:** https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_uQ4kS7xJcx2zokJTjgbL0g4rqQNRP_rA9gMl5f2WpI/edit\n  One row per asset, marked Delivered / Ready / Owed. As of today: 8 Delivered, 48 Ready, 40 still owed from us.\n\nThe brief is written for the game as it is today. If our core gameplay changes, we'll go through the affected parts with you in November."
